# applied to $HOME. See CLAUDE.md ("Repository layout") for why.
#
# The topical *.zsh directories are sourced in place out of $DOTFILES by
# dot_zshrc, and bin/ is put on $PATH by system/path.zsh -- so they must exist
# here but must not be copied into $HOME.

